QDirStat Bubbly

This is an unofficial modified variant of QDirStat 2.0.
Original project: https://github.com/shundhammer/qdirstat
Original author and copyright holder: Stefan Hundhammer and QDirStat contributors.
License: GNU General Public License version 2 only (GPL-2.0-only). See LICENSE.

Modifications for QDirStat Bubbly were made in 2026 and include:
- WizTree-style treemap color modes, palettes, and extension coloring.
- Folder padding, folder outlines, and optional folder labels.
- Treemap configuration page and WizTree preset.
- File Type Statistics color swatches.
- High-DPI cushion rendering.

